{
  "$comment": [
    "Achra MVP domain models \u2014 the coordination loop: an organization publishes",
    "an RFP, builders submit proposals, the org awards one, an agreement is",
    "created, and milestones are tracked to a recorded payout intent.",
    "",
    "Registered at runtime with POST /api/models {definition: <one of these>};",
    "no recompile and no redeploy. See",
    "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-14-achra-mvp-design.md.",
    "",
    "CONVENTION: single-owner fields (publisher, submitter, org, builder) are",
    "string[] holding exactly one entry. That is not an accident \u2014 the",
    "precondition DSL's `actor-is` compares the actor to a LITERAL string, so",
    "the only way to say 'the actor must be this document's publisher' is",
    "`actor-in` over a list field.",
    "",
    "CONFIDENTIALITY: there is none, and an earlier version of this note said",
    "otherwise. Verified in the code, not assumed: Store::summary() returns",
    "every document unfiltered, the sync tick hands that whole summary to every",
    "handshaken drive peer, and the CatchUp handler serves any doc_id it is",
    "asked for without checking membership. Group membership gates WRITES",
    "(auth, preconditions, quorum) and never reads. So any peer past the",
    "drive-level token/TOFU handshake receives every document on this node,",
    "including ones belonging to groups it is not a member of. Treat proposal",
    "amounts and agreement terms as visible to every peer you sync with. Group",
    "topology organizes and attributes; it does not separate.",
    "",
    "NAMING: every init reducer must write __name__. create_doc_model() validates a name and rejects a duplicate, but it is the reducer's __name__ write that actually registers it -- without it the document is created and then unfindable by name.",
    "PRECONDITION SYNTAX: `actor-in` takes a bare string (the field name); `field-is` / `field-not` take an OBJECT {field, value}. Mixing them up yields \"'field-is' requires a 'field' string\" at apply time, not at registration -- which is why these models are tested."
  ],
  "models": [
    {
      "name": "rfp",
      "version": "1",
      "$comment": "A published objective. Lives in the public marketplace group.",
      "fields": {
        "publisher": "string[]",
        "approvers": "string[]",
        "title": "string",
        "brief": "string",
        "budget": "number",
        "currency": "string",
        "deadline": "string",
        "status": "string",
        "winner": "string",
        "award_amount": "number"
      },
      "reducers": {
        "init": {
          "payload": {
            "name": "string",
            "title": "string",
            "brief": "string",
            "budget": "number",
            "currency": "string",
            "deadline": "string",
            "approvers": "string[]"
          },
          "writes": {
            "__name__": {
              "set": "$payload.name"
            },
            "publisher": {
              "append": "$actor"
            },
            "approvers": {
              "set": "$payload.approvers"
            },
            "title": {
              "set": "$payload.title"
            },
            "brief": {
              "set": "$payload.brief"
            },
            "budget": {
              "set": "$payload.budget"
            },
            "currency": {
              "set": "$payload.currency"
            },
            "deadline": {
              "set": "$payload.deadline"
            },
            "status": {
              "set": "open"
            }
          }
        },
        "cancel": {
          "payload": {},
          "writes": {
            "status": {
              "set": "cancelled"
            }
          },
          "pre": [
            {
              "actor-in": "publisher"
            },
            {
              "field-is": {
                "field": "status",
                "value": "open"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "award": {
          "$comment": [
            "EVERY award needs two distinct approvers to sign, not only awards",
            "above a threshold. The design called for a per-amount threshold,",
            "but quorum() is declared per REDUCER KIND and cannot branch on a",
            "payload value \u2014 so a conditional quorum is not expressible. Rather",
            "than add an `award-large` variant nothing would compel anyone to",
            "use, awarding is always a two-person decision. That is stricter",
            "than specified, and simpler to reason about.",
            "",
            "The quorum reads `approvers` from the RFP document itself via",
            "$self, so it is the publishing org's own people who must agree \u2014",
            "not any two members of the marketplace."
          ],
          "payload": {
            "builder": "string",
            "amount": "number"
          },
          "writes": {
            "status": {
              "set": "awarded"
            },
            "winner": {
              "set": "$payload.builder"
            },
            "award_amount": {
              "set": "$payload.amount"
            }
          },
          "pre": [
            {
              "field-is": {
                "field": "status",
                "value": "open"
              }
            },
            {
              "quorum": {
                "group": "$self",
                "min": 2,
                "field": "approvers"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "proposal",
      "version": "1",
      "$comment": "A builder's bid. Lives in the org<->builder engagement group only.",
      "fields": {
        "rfp_ref": "string",
        "submitter": "string[]",
        "summary": "string",
        "amount": "number",
        "status": "string"
      },
      "reducers": {
        "init": {
          "payload": {
            "name": "string",
            "rfp_ref": "string",
            "summary": "string",
            "amount": "number"
          },
          "writes": {
            "__name__": {
              "set": "$payload.name"
            },
            "rfp_ref": {
              "set": "$payload.rfp_ref"
            },
            "submitter": {
              "append": "$actor"
            },
            "summary": {
              "set": "$payload.summary"
            },
            "amount": {
              "set": "$payload.amount"
            },
            "status": {
              "set": "submitted"
            }
          }
        },
        "withdraw": {
          "payload": {},
          "writes": {
            "status": {
              "set": "withdrawn"
            }
          },
          "pre": [
            {
              "actor-in": "submitter"
            },
            {
              "field-is": {
                "field": "status",
                "value": "submitted"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "accept": {
          "payload": {},
          "writes": {
            "status": {
              "set": "accepted"
            }
          },
          "pre": [
            {
              "actor-not-in": "submitter"
            },
            {
              "field-is": {
                "field": "status",
                "value": "submitted"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "decline": {
          "payload": {},
          "writes": {
            "status": {
              "set": "declined"
            }
          },
          "pre": [
            {
              "actor-not-in": "submitter"
            },
            {
              "field-is": {
                "field": "status",
                "value": "submitted"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "agreement",
      "version": "1",
      "$comment": "The accepted engagement. Lives in the engagement group.",
      "fields": {
        "rfp_ref": "string",
        "proposal_ref": "string",
        "org": "string[]",
        "builder": "string[]",
        "total": "number",
        "status": "string"
      },
      "reducers": {
        "init": {
          "payload": {
            "name": "string",
            "rfp_ref": "string",
            "proposal_ref": "string",
            "builder": "string",
            "total": "number"
          },
          "writes": {
            "__name__": {
              "set": "$payload.name"
            },
            "rfp_ref": {
              "set": "$payload.rfp_ref"
            },
            "proposal_ref": {
              "set": "$payload.proposal_ref"
            },
            "org": {
              "append": "$actor"
            },
            "builder": {
              "append": "$payload.builder"
            },
            "total": {
              "set": "$payload.total"
            },
            "status": {
              "set": "active"
            }
          }
        },
        "complete": {
          "payload": {},
          "writes": {
            "status": {
              "set": "completed"
            }
          },
          "pre": [
            {
              "actor-in": "org"
            },
            {
              "field-is": {
                "field": "status",
                "value": "active"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "terminate": {
          "payload": {
            "reason": "string"
          },
          "writes": {
            "status": {
              "set": "terminated"
            }
          },
          "pre": [
            {
              "actor-in": "org"
            },
            {
              "field-is": {
                "field": "status",
                "value": "active"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "milestone",
      "version": "1",
      "$comment": [
        "A unit of delivery. `accepted` records a payout INTENT only \u2014 no",
        "money moves. Settlement is explicitly out of scope for the MVP."
      ],
      "fields": {
        "agreement_ref": "string",
        "org": "string[]",
        "builder": "string[]",
        "title": "string",
        "amount": "number",
        "evidence": "string",
        "status": "string"
      },
      "reducers": {
        "init": {
          "payload": {
            "name": "string",
            "agreement_ref": "string",
            "builder": "string",
            "title": "string",
            "amount": "number"
          },
          "writes": {
            "__name__": {
              "set": "$payload.name"
            },
            "agreement_ref": {
              "set": "$payload.agreement_ref"
            },
            "org": {
              "append": "$actor"
            },
            "builder": {
              "append": "$payload.builder"
            },
            "title": {
              "set": "$payload.title"
            },
            "amount": {
              "set": "$payload.amount"
            },
            "status": {
              "set": "pending"
            }
          }
        },
        "submit": {
          "$comment": "Only the builder may claim a milestone is done.",
          "payload": {
            "evidence": "string"
          },
          "writes": {
            "evidence": {
              "set": "$payload.evidence"
            },
            "status": {
              "set": "submitted"
            }
          },
          "pre": [
            {
              "actor-in": "builder"
            },
            {
              "field-is": {
                "field": "status",
                "value": "pending"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "accept": {
          "$comment": "Only the org may accept it. Records payout intent.",
          "payload": {},
          "writes": {
            "status": {
              "set": "accepted"
            }
          },
          "pre": [
            {
              "actor-in": "org"
            },
            {
              "field-is": {
                "field": "status",
                "value": "submitted"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "reject": {
          "payload": {
            "reason": "string"
          },
          "writes": {
            "status": {
              "set": "pending"
            }
          },
          "pre": [
            {
              "actor-in": "org"
            },
            {
              "field-is": {
                "field": "status",
                "value": "submitted"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
